{"resourceIdentifier":"2645","resourceName":"BALIKESİR LANDFILL GAS (LFG) CAPTURE AND UTILIZATION PROJECT","description":"Balıkesir Landfill Gas (LFG) Capture and Utilization Project is being implemented by Landfill Enerji Sanayi ve Ticaret A.Ş. within the boundaries of Balıkesir Solid Waste Disposal Site (SWDS) in Balıkesir province in Turkey.\r\n\r\nThe proposed project activity has the installed capacity of “14.14 MWe/h”. \r\n\r\nIt is planned to rehabilitate the SWDS that receives around 1,200 tons of municipal waste generated at Balıkesir province per day and to generate renewable electric power by capturing and utilizing landfill gas.\r\n\r\nWhilst providing sustainable development benefits to the host communities and the host country, the proposed project activity will reduce greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions mainly by \r\n\r\n•\tpreventing GHG emissions, methane in particular, from being emitted directly to the atmosphere from waste at the Balıkesir SWDS that would be otherwise left to be decomposed;\r\n•\treplacing the electricity that would have otherwise been generated by the national grid which is heavily dependent on fossil-fuel-based resources, through generating renewable energy and feeding it to the grid.\r\n\r\nThe project has begun to generate electricity on October 27th, 2019, which is regarded as the project start date. \r\n\r\nThis project adopts a fixed crediting period of 10 years. The expected average annual emission reductions are 185,502 tCO2eq/y. Accordingly, the project is expected to generate 1,855,020 tCO2eq emissions reduction throughout the crediting period.","location":{"latitude":39.612794,"longitude":27.853133},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-03-25","endExclusive":"2022-04-25","endInclusive":"2022-04-24"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2645"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Balıkesir Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2645"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"334919"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"TÜV SÜD South Asia Private Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"26/10/2022"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 27/10/2019 - 26/10/2026"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=56514&IDKEY=aq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhk77932806","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-V4.1-BalD1kesir Landfill Gas (LFG) Capture and Utilization Project-Rev01-(ID2645)-010921.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-10-05T07:24:49.91Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=56461&IDKEY=q8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0n77859719","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Multiple-Representors-v4.1-BalD1kesir LFG Project-(ID2645)-200821.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-10-04T04:46:41.247Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=77126&IDKEY=fiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkf106356754","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS_BALIKESD0R_Project_Description_TR_06.10.2022_clean.pdf